# Cloud / git handoff

- Work on `cloud-handoff/*` or a feature branch. Never commit, push, or merge to `main` unless the user names that action.
- Never target PROD. Never auto-merge.
- Daily tests: Fast / Affected. Do not start LeoVer-QA or Maestro unless explicitly requested.
- Cloud must not declare physical or Maestro E2E PASS.
- Never commit secrets (`.env`, `local.properties`, QA local JSON, service_role, keystores).
- Do not edit applied migrations.

Details: `AGENTS.md`, `docs/cloud/CURSOR-CLOUD-SETUP.md`, `.cursor/rules/leover-regression-done.mdc`.
